  "asset": "<figure class=\"docs-asset-shell not-prose my-10\"><div class=\"docs-asset-frame\"><video src=\"https://melty.t3.storage.dev/workflow.mp4\" aria-label=\"Conductor workflow overview\" controls=\"\" playsinline=\"\" class=\"docs-asset-media docs-asset-video\"></video></div><div class=\"sr-only\"><p>Video summary: <!-- -->Conductor workflow overview</p><p>The video walks through adding a repository, creating isolated workspaces for separate tasks, running the app, reviewing agent changes, sending Diff Viewer comments back to the agent, creating a pull request, watching GitHub checks, merging, and archiving the finished workspace.</p></div></figure>",
